WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.896
Ɗo'o ɗon haaje mawɗe, ɗe njokki dow duniyaaru.

00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:06.143
Walaa gooduɗo nyaamugo ɗe.

00:00:06.223 --> 00:00:10.292
Ɓe mbi'i ɗum'en naa' kalluɗi bana kalluɗe goɗɗe.

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:14.267
Ɓe laatoto laamiiɓe ndiyam, e ko ɓuri ɗum boo.
